# Git Basics :

This section covers the fundamental Git commands required to work with a Git repository.

#🎯 Learning Objectives

- What Git is
- What GitHub is
- How to clone a repository
- How to check repository status
- How to add files to the staging area
- How to commit changes
- How to push changes to GitHub
- Basic Git workflow

---

## 🔄 Basic Git Workflow

The basic workflow for sending local changes to GitHub is:

```text
Create / Modify File
        ↓
   git status
        ↓
     git add
        ↓
   git commit
        ↓
    git push
        ↓
      GitHub

